# ZevSafe Android AI Agent Rules

CRITICAL: Whenever you modify, add, refactor, or delete ANY file or code in this repository:
1. Read and update `PROJECT_MEMORY.md` and the relevant files in `PROJECT-MEMORY/` (`CRYPTOGRAPHIC_SPECIFICATION.md`, `ARCHITECTURE_AND_COMPONENTS.md`, `STREAMING_AND_MEMORY_BOUNDS.md`, `BUILD_RELEASE_AND_CICD.md`, `DEVELOPMENT_AND_AI_GUIDELINES.md`) so any AI agent can immediately understand the current architecture and state.
2. Update `CHANGELOG.md` with the new changes under the appropriate version.
3. Update `README.md` (version badges, release details, feature tables).
4. Verify all unit tests pass: `./gradlew test`.
